    "answer": {
      "short": "$P=(0,1)$.",
      "worked": "A tangent parallel to the $x$-axis has gradient $0$.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{dy}{dx}&=8x\\\\8x&=0\\\\x&=0\\\\y&=4(0)^2+1\\\\y&=1\\end{align*}$$\n\nTherefore, $P=(0,1)$.",
